            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I'm a bit confused, sorry if this is not the right spot to ask this, but can you show hidden files with fd now?\n\nBecouse when I do something like..\n\n```lua\nMiniPick.builtin.files({ tool = \"fd --hidden\" })\n```\n\nthen it tells me this is the wrong tool for `files`, but i don't see any other way of configuring the fd behaviour other than flags like `--hidden` or `-H`.\n\nAm i doing something wrong? ",
